  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "你的离世似乎让人难以置信，宗孟先生，尽管至今你的亲人们仍无法找到你的遗骸。",
      "output_sha256": "6e9821be448d69edd097d9c7b21cd6aa822587412b9e87c7def3df3f9a5f04b3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.427756,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "23d470975904d30a95af52dd2311d425f4ddcd87c94af4aaa433eb2f57cbda56"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6e9821be448d69edd097d9c7b21cd6aa822587412b9e87c7def3df3f9a5f04b3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "最初消息来时，我只是不信，那其实是太兀突，太荒唐，太不近情。",
      "output_sha256": "fc276ffa6daf012ff53081829b04d60f8e35338dca17c6da6e255937c330b4ee",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "fc276ffa6daf012ff53081829b04d60f8e35338dca17c6da6e255937c330b4ee",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我曾经几回梦见你生还，叙述你历险的始末，多活现的梦境！",
      "output_sha256": "e77d411a45f4b34e9914a107af7782eb114f084b5db5332a805662e859ebd5b7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "e77d411a45f4b34e9914a107af7782eb114f084b5db5332a805662e859ebd5b7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但如今在栝树凋零尽了青枝的庭院，再不闻「老人」的謦欬；真的没了，四壁的白联仿佛在微风中叹息。",
      "output_sha256": "1237c0af96330ad29819803456df4050e09a506cd507df297f16935089a9387a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "1237c0af96330ad29819803456df4050e09a506cd507df297f16935089a9387a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这三四十天来，哭泣的人有你的妻子、姐妹、亲戚，也有为你哀悼的朋友和无数热爱你的士人。",
      "output_sha256": "81b6b2a4df5bdd4c86b88ce6f901ce1b793a0e7f5d94e0b250d07aa1fd54f0ab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.454861,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "749f72b918d738c1d1d8abc7696560f1fca3c8cb2116d3f85e07e3356d281f73"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "81b6b2a4df5bdd4c86b88ce6f901ce1b793a0e7f5d94e0b250d07aa1fd54f0ab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "志摩是你的一个忘年的小友。",
      "output_sha256": "bb5a588a2950af6ad3633603f361761e1c6a7fa5fcfd9f18db951d24ca1523b0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "bb5a588a2950af6ad3633603f361761e1c6a7fa5fcfd9f18db951d24ca1523b0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我不来敷陈你的事功，不来历叙你的言行；我也不来再加一份涕泪吊你最后的惨变。",
      "output_sha256": "ddfb7f167071af31d5a159de959405d15deb55c950646f7f85d5a5b70755eb3b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "ddfb7f167071af31d5a159de959405d15deb55c950646f7f85d5a5b70755eb3b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "魂兮归来！",
      "output_sha256": "264b54736530ef0e721bdf03fb01e612b981567c5227af5cada257c4d1f33ea8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "264b54736530ef0e721bdf03fb01e612b981567c5227af5cada257c4d1f33ea8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "此时在一个风雨交加的深夜，我握笔思绪万千：一是你的幽默风趣，二是那些失去父亲的弟妹们。",
      "output_sha256": "a258bbfa964734030d41886ef7671f4b51ff7944319686cd1455481db2c3b9cc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.425809,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "afc2af1fb4a7060015236560b1c4f76681894f078402334b79fb6c7f48b299e7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a258bbfa964734030d41886ef7671f4b51ff7944319686cd1455481db2c3b9cc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9,
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "曾几何时，那些日子里你对他们的关怀，如今我想象你的灵魂也一定在他们身边徘徊。",
      "output_sha256": "ee90fe66bd3dcab636b3ffd9c79818f0a6ba95c7c58613121d3553ae63c2f913",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.425809,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "afc2af1fb4a7060015236560b1c4f76681894f078402334b79fb6c7f48b299e7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ee90fe66bd3dcab636b3ffd9c79818f0a6ba95c7c58613121d3553ae63c2f913",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9,
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "平日里与你相见，我乐于倾听你的妙语，静静感受你的智慧，不让我的愚笨打扰你的光辉，但今后再也无法得到这样的幸福了！",
      "output_sha256": "8c16daf15bf851ce45b09e2b6836ef612008c37980b8abbb95a2c57347c2af63",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.417865,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9598c4948f703569d673c4d31f3e9e5cac47bd2233460cd59887a6ac47473e35"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8c16daf15bf851ce45b09e2b6836ef612008c37980b8abbb95a2c57347c2af63",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我只希望你仍在我身旁，和我闲聊，哪怕只是些琐碎的事，我想你可能会觉得烦吧。",
      "output_sha256": "b7546dba8e74ff39ab6ee9320af5a4e3a7ff140bd9fb5c2429715ab11c3c1d6c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.395066,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a942f6d94aaef45895eced4e36db79314e37ee7349a125333486dc5f49eb38d7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b7546dba8e74ff39ab6ee9320af5a4e3a7ff140bd9fb5c2429715ab11c3c1d6c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "首先，谈谈你的弟妹们。",
      "output_sha256": "f8fa9915a03540ac65b113e7969acedbbb7acc2084e3e76e49f36501e7314ed2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.548333,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cb99c1c8f7cc7e2a8f21377152ce540fe44c3d8ea075dbccbb7a0663fa44e779"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f8fa9915a03540ac65b113e7969acedbbb7acc2084e3e76e49f36501e7314ed2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你知道我与小孩子们说得来，每回我到你家去，他们一群四五个，连著眼珠最黑的小五，浪一般的拥上我的身来，牵住我的手，攀住我的头，问这样，问那样；我要走时他们就著了忙，抢帽子的，锁门的，嗄著声音苦求的——你也曾见过我的狼狈。",
      "output_sha256": "58ef8a88baebdaa7f530f458b4dc4e071ae6cfe385c05bbd007d887324b1ed9d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "58ef8a88baebdaa7f530f458b4dc4e071ae6cfe385c05bbd007d887324b1ed9d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "自从你的噩耗到后，可怜的孩子们，从不满四岁到十一岁，那懂得生死的意义，但看了大人们严肃的神情，他们也都发了呆，一个个木鸡似的在人前楞著。",
      "output_sha256": "1bf28abf9b023b59f2a6a40d12ee0e848ba70cd5313e46d5c9f8c1ef8e740550",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "1bf28abf9b023b59f2a6a40d12ee0e848ba70cd5313e46d5c9f8c1ef8e740550",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有一天听说他们私下在商量，想组织一队童子军，冲出山海关去替爸爸报仇！",
      "output_sha256": "e17e03da48660217c3a8e041c69f666af5611f6e7f8aab58b70f31de8e07ea95",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "e17e03da48660217c3a8e041c69f666af5611f6e7f8aab58b70f31de8e07ea95",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "栝安」那电报到的一个早上，我正在你家。",
      "output_sha256": "c6cdf781d45a31c7264d1d798826f855aad179ad50f0eefee6de1c400eddc3d6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "c6cdf781d45a31c7264d1d798826f855aad179ad50f0eefee6de1c400eddc3d6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "忽然间一阵天翻似皂闹声从外院陡起，一群孩子拥著一位手拿报纸的大声的欢呼著，冲锋似的陷进了上房。",
      "output_sha256": "2a9c8c4408f6f30d92584d047a6eae22957d53b0605c621a6b11f29376afa9e8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "2a9c8c4408f6f30d92584d047a6eae22957d53b0605c621a6b11f29376afa9e8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "果然是大胜利，该庆祝的：「爹爹没有事！」",
      "output_sha256": "d4d6a4b1c7329431f38a6c50d7b49f6c1a7aa7cffeb1fc96f16819c49554b5a6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "d4d6a4b1c7329431f38a6c50d7b49f6c1a7aa7cffeb1fc96f16819c49554b5a6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "「爹爹好好的！」",
      "output_sha256": "e315de5c019f349384e108a3e827289482c15f52b17be4bdf0167fa56ee5373d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "e315de5c019f349384e108a3e827289482c15f52b17be4bdf0167fa56ee5373d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "从徽那里发来的平安电报立刻送了出去，省得她焦急。",
      "output_sha256": "cdeee4532f92093d3becaf709a631dcb1b8cb7f6069ae0cfc9b07974c1eac551",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.439954,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20,
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6aa00dec3f6cccdb135de932f1400a7952476287364c065b37ebbbe34ab4f70e",
        "f3862c4da1191e40fae9b213fe6b64e50b6cd3f42782d022eff8a51afb15d8ff"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cdeee4532f92093d3becaf709a631dcb1b8cb7f6069ae0cfc9b07974c1eac551",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但这欢喜的风景运定活不到三天，又叫接著来的消息给完全煞尽！",
      "output_sha256": "3c400c219f1b2df2ce2f4d72d6f5dcc283946841be061a8bed98af352b7beb4e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "3c400c219f1b2df2ce2f4d72d6f5dcc283946841be061a8bed98af352b7beb4e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "当初和你同行的那些人回来了，证实了你的死讯。",
      "output_sha256": "ce1a7dd45908dac5f6cab54d7fb2b839c750417386c92e6494609a35f91663cc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.598609,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "aac623f4e199cfa964a6aac486256c74b807a77b39dfb69de00939784460c467"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ce1a7dd45908dac5f6cab54d7fb2b839c750417386c92e6494609a35f91663cc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那晚，你的骨肉一个个走进你的卧房，各自默恻恻的坐下，阿，那一阵子最难堪的噤寂，千万种痛心的思潮在各个人的心头，在这沉默的暗惨中，激荡，汹涌，起伏。",
      "output_sha256": "51ae333e1cc1bc50948665b80cf0e1e0ada0f3ae289f9876e89800f7e2c932bc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "51ae333e1cc1bc50948665b80cf0e1e0ada0f3ae289f9876e89800f7e2c932bc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可怜的孩子们也都泪滢滢的攒聚在一处，相互的偎著，半懂得情景的严重。",
      "output_sha256": "be77bb7e3a6e6c1cc6de010f6e13557c1b24b6e845bc0695e8e83890c62573fd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "be77bb7e3a6e6c1cc6de010f6e13557c1b24b6e845bc0695e8e83890c62573fd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "就在这时，沉默被打破，他们开始放声痛哭，亲情间的悲哀——你听到了吗，宗孟先生，那晚有一轮黄月斜照北海白塔的凄凉？",
      "output_sha256": "9cff85a9bc48a65aefcaefaf40c80c18d29796f0d928bc1c898b23044b133938",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.58968,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "99b0a3a7015e8511a2a88a06ed12b717213c8c3ebb52aec4f7f41d747d33b37f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9cff85a9bc48a65aefcaefaf40c80c18d29796f0d928bc1c898b23044b133938",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我知道你不能忘情这一群童稚的弟妹。",
      "output_sha256": "f5acd397d9c9b0701654371e8845e5f93b043792fbdaa7ba0b9d628a2a72d3dd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "f5acd397d9c9b0701654371e8845e5f93b043792fbdaa7ba0b9d628a2a72d3dd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "前晚我去你家时，看到小四和小五在灵位前翻跟斗，就如你在世时他们常在你面前表演一样。",
      "output_sha256": "c5e751689da15a56c385c691006bbe0158b0e0fe4072a8b10108cea65206a9da",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.651703,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9c0f336b1aee4d459f2f3fa936eb926974bf1fb8e9083f09f9034a5c002fbfe4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c5e751689da15a56c385c691006bbe0158b0e0fe4072a8b10108cea65206a9da",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "「你爹呢？」",
      "output_sha256": "46e7365b25ff170b805f274b90531a3f10e5a3cf2885be8e892aa750eb0b6db9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "46e7365b25ff170b805f274b90531a3f10e5a3cf2885be8e892aa750eb0b6db9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我拉住他们问。",
      "output_sha256": "e41350f649303c963665869c801f90a98102d30d98feeda64c155060be707454",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "e41350f649303c963665869c801f90a98102d30d98feeda64c155060be707454",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "「爹死了」，他们嘻嘻的回答，小五搂住小四，一和身又滚做一堆！",
      "output_sha256": "651567bc848a1720a99db98f6a1b1592a021888ca88af08be04e50aeb84b84a1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "651567bc848a1720a99db98f6a1b1592a021888ca88af08be04e50aeb84b84a1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他们未来的成长，成为你离世后唯一令人担忧的事情——说到这里，我不由得想起你离开前最后几次的谈话。",
      "output_sha256": "329e65af226fc4341666e829b9aca53a32b273139ac2af56c0a0ae0c22ad2f02",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.585351,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "49afab0cfb245ce3f9a1bf8cef0fe4a8d15d12cd9538ab31c9a813dae128e4da"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "329e65af226fc4341666e829b9aca53a32b273139ac2af56c0a0ae0c22ad2f02",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "你曾说你对政治生涯不仅感到厌倦，而且已经厌烦。",
      "output_sha256": "868e04ad7938548563ca5ba5e98aaa60430862a8b897d067927b97ab563d1cfd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.421976,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6ce4edede4854e107da0824830f06167d3ebedddc120a36e3711585740d11718"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "868e04ad7938548563ca5ba5e98aaa60430862a8b897d067927b97ab563d1cfd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这五十年算是一个结束，明年起你准备谢绝俗缘，亲自教课膝前的子女；这一清心你就可以用功你的书法，你自觉你腕下的精力，老来只是健进，你打算化二十年工夫，打磨你艺术的天才；文书你本来不弱，但你想望的却不是什么等身的著述，你只求沥一生的心得，淘成三篇不易衰朽的纯晶。",
      "output_sha256": "1ee4b8bdc6016e4cdef614b94a931546bd0c019bcdbdf7f0adc55da89c32a42e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "1ee4b8bdc6016e4cdef614b94a931546bd0c019bcdbdf7f0adc55da89c32a42e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这在你是一种觉悟；早年在国外初识面时，你每每自负你政治的异禀，即在年前避居津地时你还以为前途不少有为的希望，直至最近政态诡变，你才内省厌倦，认真想回复你书生逸士的生涯。",
      "output_sha256": "9b6820c66f2b377ca43e7963d8aa28122b7b03563554a5561a731ba9e635421e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "9b6820c66f2b377ca43e7963d8aa28122b7b03563554a5561a731ba9e635421e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我从最初惊讶你清奇的相貌，惊讶你更清奇的谈吐，我便不阿附你从政的热心，曾经有多少次我讽劝你趁早回航，领导这新时期的精神，共同发现文艺的新土。",
      "output_sha256": "bbe6cc7900204834ee40b53c5318f746e387d6392e2f3c50526e5aad0060b5a2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "bbe6cc7900204834ee40b53c5318f746e387d6392e2f3c50526e5aad0060b5a2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "即如前年泰戈尔来时，你那兴会正不让我们年轻人；你这半百翁登台演戏，不辞劳倦的精神正不知给了我们多少的鼓舞！",
      "output_sha256": "cb926db645e9eca98136deb5f8f109a0b8a7e7e7adda855330a3351e5918b4d6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "cb926db645e9eca98136deb5f8f109a0b8a7e7e7adda855330a3351e5918b4d6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不，你不是「老人」；你至少是我们后生中间的一个。",
      "output_sha256": "028d5b702d670fac380eae6115554b0f68eb1915650a521c551985d114bbb6ee",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "028d5b702d670fac380eae6115554b0f68eb1915650a521c551985d114bbb6ee",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在你的精神里，我们看不见苍苍的鬓发，看不见五十年光阴的痕迹；你的依旧是二三十年前「春痕」故事里的「逸」的风情——「万种风情无地著」，是你最得意的名句，谁料这下文竟命定是「辽原白雪葬华颠」！",
      "output_sha256": "16f4011b496eaca0247783e680fa1e3c67ed67b46cd723fdc351b778b8f3c46d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "16f4011b496eaca0247783e680fa1e3c67ed67b46cd723fdc351b778b8f3c46d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "谁说你不是君房的后身？",
      "output_sha256": "b4fa6b42c495bcc42bf6a1a7bb5fe6cddf180f6fb170c9b1c64a8073a1c11bf0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "b4fa6b42c495bcc42bf6a1a7bb5fe6cddf180f6fb170c9b1c64a8073a1c11bf0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "可惜的是，那些摇曳多姿的言辞当时未曾流露，满含警句与幽默的回忆，如今只剩遥远的航影，再也难以辨认。",
      "output_sha256": "33ecab8e8941dce855f46ce83131c41b4f92e6ddd05abbec863077cbcf5555c0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.439254,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7ce88aacf9179a236a85a64d2fd201ebc88c5a5e1a20610431742314b544c969"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "33ecab8e8941dce855f46ce83131c41b4f92e6ddd05abbec863077cbcf5555c0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你常常自称厌世人。",
      "output_sha256": "62e4db7d4966becde14b87c9018677504048ae994702ec8f1d4b9b50c58880ab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "62e4db7d4966becde14b87c9018677504048ae994702ec8f1d4b9b50c58880ab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "果然，这世间，这人情，怎能承受得住你锐利的理智的剖析与挑剔？",
      "output_sha256": "f3f142618a6d080b6688e83dda9d1c3f3da8e27dd8a7825e21878ce132f5ab9a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.622805,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c72af5f2f7b5aa17615cbf200f3a1fdce479fb21d220817382781e98f7e0fa10"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f3f142618a6d080b6688e83dda9d1c3f3da8e27dd8a7825e21878ce132f5ab9a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "有人说你的锋芒是你一生最大的损失。",
      "output_sha256": "fc53ad0f51dd3fc4dd8dbf8b2cea71701ce3d66b0444b31277bfeed6688f6802",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.60869,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ed6c4f7b5475e7ece1f296776224cb59da3b7c927e7cf98383cef1e482a695d8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fc53ad0f51dd3fc4dd8dbf8b2cea71701ce3d66b0444b31277bfeed6688f6802",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "但你所厌恶的不过是虚伪、矫情、顽固和乡愿，那岂不正是应有之义？",
      "output_sha256": "22376267ed37c4c50ee6295a7537c923cba4fdafcfb41dc431a183cd26c722d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.537018,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "09adb8f0d0425a13cd32d3ecf41aa0dd5af3d953bd7f0d18ddbaeaab6ef90e42"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_ai_sha256": "22376267ed37c4c50ee6295a7537c923cba4fdafcfb41dc431a183cd26c722d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "谁有你的豪爽，谁有你的倜傥，谁有你的幽默？",
      "output_sha256": "4a7d41d6fffddbefb09080812e5babb8081d72961f75078998fed6c688130dc5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "4a7d41d6fffddbefb09080812e5babb8081d72961f75078998fed6c688130dc5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "你的锋芒，即使展现，也并非完全施加于他人身上，你何尝放过自己？",
      "output_sha256": "742abaa4648a40652aecbc3f43250962bf36677529fc3a0e3b554b36c35e5db0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": 0.637635,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4592a22a5291c53b0f06597110501563b318dd7236f9350bc6fcf0b3cbd3e3df"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "742abaa4648a40652aecbc3f43250962bf36677529fc3a0e3b554b36c35e5db0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "对待自己如同对待他人，你从未留有余地，这在如今这个虚情假意的时代实属难能可贵。",
      "output_sha256": "3f348c97ecd28d7b7a81e6299a8466e78693e5fa0d5b563f88072083a2c8e8ab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.322205,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        48,
        49
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "854d044690b871e56eab456d297c4d3d4bbd721d81a685aa9b39b2f06e7cd2e3",
        "1a6d2bfc79eb0cdbb82dffaf35016565b2df7d27a39a9b712efb1d6949156d29"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3f348c97ecd28d7b7a81e6299a8466e78693e5fa0d5b563f88072083a2c8e8ab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "再没有第二人，除了你，能给我这样脆爽的清谈的愉快。",
      "output_sha256": "7ae185fad4e9a3244fb9afbd96be4e7122fe4347bad58565b0fc41221df39c67",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "7ae185fad4e9a3244fb9afbd96be4e7122fe4347bad58565b0fc41221df39c67",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "再没有第二人在我的前辈中，除了你，能使我感受这样的无「执」无「我」的精神。",
      "output_sha256": "86aae44756354897ebb729bf715ac6370ed6a8a44b5d1703bcc0e2e24e6073de",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "86aae44756354897ebb729bf715ac6370ed6a8a44b5d1703bcc0e2e24e6073de",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "最可怜是远在海外的徽徽，她，你曾经对我说，是你唯一的知己；你，她曾对我说，是她唯一的知己。",
      "output_sha256": "ae7195e551bcf8f00e51fdce9eeb9d39aad889e12863469fa62594a99bb91589",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "ae7195e551bcf8f00e51fdce9eeb9d39aad889e12863469fa62594a99bb91589",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你们这父女不是寻常的父女。",
      "output_sha256": "c703a000d0584dd44fbfed53ec525f73e37039df77eccddaafafdffcb05a99b9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "c703a000d0584dd44fbfed53ec525f73e37039df77eccddaafafdffcb05a99b9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "「做一个有天才的女儿的父亲」，你曾说：「不是容易享的福，你得放低你天伦的辈分先求做到友谊的了解。」",
      "output_sha256": "991b44716e39f5ef40d361295b78117398ad736484762da8961aadeb89e88e24",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "991b44716e39f5ef40d361295b78117398ad736484762da8961aadeb89e88e24",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "徽，不用说，一生崇拜的就只你，她一生理想的计划中，那件事离得了聪明不让她自己的老父？",
      "output_sha256": "0c92553058fd7e64f0f34ca8873597078bc80be586b5ae7444a41d73a91fcd27",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "0c92553058fd7e64f0f34ca8873597078bc80be586b5ae7444a41d73a91fcd27",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但如今，说也可怜，一切都成了梦幻，隔著这万里途程，她那弱小的心灵如何载得起这奇重的哀惨！",
      "output_sha256": "19980f6c565c0d3afbc53c2b1a6fe20d97caa75c54bd24f339973cb94040b599",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "19980f6c565c0d3afbc53c2b1a6fe20d97caa75c54bd24f339973cb94040b599",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这终天的缺陷，叫她问谁补去？",
      "output_sha256": "2c1cd6c2f9731fd2a6ba00860249b0ed12e66d17e26e33688529ed6eb00ce87b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "2c1cd6c2f9731fd2a6ba00860249b0ed12e66d17e26e33688529ed6eb00ce87b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "佑著她吧，你不昧的阴灵，宗孟先生，给她健康，给她幸福，尤其给她艺术的灵术——同时提携她的弟妹，共同增荣雪池双栝的清名！",
      "output_sha256": "f001cc25f4fa8b113798ab17879ea32e622c82d3fae9fe232f9801fb1c44dc9e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "f001cc25f4fa8b113798ab17879ea32e622c82d3fae9fe232f9801fb1c44dc9e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
